<title>UK: CADES sets 10.0 bln FRF October 2000 bond, +6 b.p.</title>
<headline>CADES sets 10.0 bln FRF October 2000 bond, +6 b.p.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Paribas and Societe Generale .</p>
<p> BORROWER   CADES - CAISSE D'AMORTISSEMENT DE LA DETTE SOCIALE</p>
<p> AMT     10 BLN FRF   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    12.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.131   PAY DATE    03.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    99.811    SPREAD	+6 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 2</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BTAN DUE OCTOBER 2000</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
